  itemName: Bathroom Shelf
  description: This bathroom shelf features a sleek, minimalist design that blends
    seamlessly into contemporary interiors. Crafted from durable, moisture-resistant
    materials, it provides practical storage space for toiletries, towels, and everyday
    essentials.
  descriptionAlbanian: "Ky raft tualeti ka nj\xEB dizajn elegant dhe minimalist q\xEB
